---
# QA hub for the team on the GitHub Pages preview. Ignored in single-landing (LANDING=) builds (see eleventy.config.js).
permalink: /
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Pedlex — Landing pages (preview)"
pageDescription: "Internal preview of the Pedlex campaign landing pages. Not for public distribution."
bodyClass: "page-hub"
---
<section class="section hub">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Luxy Media · Internal preview</p>
    <h1 class="hub__title">Pedlex campaign landing pages</h1>
    <p class="hub__lead">Working build for team QA. FR is the master; EN follows. Every page is <code>noindex</code> and tracking is off in previews.</p>
    <ul class="hub__list" role="list">
      {%- for e in landings %}
      <li class="hub__item">
        <span class="hub__slug">{{ e.slug }}</span>
        <span class="hub__lang">{{ e.lang | upper }}</span>
        <a href="{{ e.url | url }}">Landing</a>
        <a href="{{ e.thanksUrl | url }}">Thank-you</a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="hub__meta">Build {{ build.commit }} · {{ build.timestamp }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
